Climate input data and observed reference map:
  The files prec.bin, temp.bin, ipar.bin, psup.bin, lsmk.bin, uwind.bin and
  Lapola_et_al_T062.bin are third-party scientific data.  They are included
  for scientific reproducibility, but their licences are not stated in the
  original delivery and they are not covered by the MIT License.  The QGIS
  palette vegetacao_referencia.qml is included with the reference material.
  See legacy/data/README.md for provenance, checksums and placement.  Rights
  holders may open an issue to request removal.

Article:
  Lapola, D. M.; Oyama, M. D.; Nobre, C. A. Exploring the range of climate
  biome projections for tropical South America: the role of CO2 fertilization
  and seasonality.  Global Biogeochemical Cycles, v. 23, GB3002, 2009.
  DOI: 10.1029/2008GB003357.  The publisher PDF is not included in this
  repository.  The older technical report by Lapola et al. (2006) is also not
  included.

Model references:
  Oyama, M. D.; Nobre, C. A. A simple potential vegetation model for coupling
  with the Simple Biosphere Model (SiB).  Revista Brasileira de Meteorologia,
  v. 19, n. 2, p. 203-216, 2004.
  Lapola, D. M. et al. 2006 (see docs/legacy_code_audit.md).

